# Third-party licences

sonicdiar (MIT OR Apache-2.0) contains the following open-source Rust crates. Native code
built into them includes whisper.cpp (MIT) and a Rust port of the WebRTC audio processing
module (BSD-3-Clause). Downloaded at run time, not shipped: ONNX Runtime (MIT) and the models
listed in `models/manifest.json` with their licences (Silero VAD MIT, Whisper MIT,
IndicConformer MIT, pyannote segmentation-3.0 MIT, WeSpeaker ResNet34 CC BY 4.0 - attribution:
WeSpeaker / VoxCeleb).

